33	30	Serbuk gergaji kayu	Kayu	800	t	1500.00	Singosari, Malang	Serutan kayu berwarna krem muda hingga cokelat sangat muda dengan permukaan berserat dan menggulung tipis. Material tampak kering dan cukup bersih, tanpa sisa kulit kayu atau benda lain yang mencolok, meski ada sedikit pecahan halus di antaranya. Bentuknya serpihan panjang menggulung, bukan serbuk halus, dengan lebar diperkirakan beberapa milimeter dan panjang bervariasi. Umumnya dipakai sebagai bahan baku briket, media tanam jamur, alas kandang, atau campuran kompos.	Singosari, Malang	\N	kg	[0.00678225,0.048527796,-0.011278115,0.024192635,0.03657988,-0.076735,-0.025339168,-0.06335995,0.02387419,-0.007271271,-0.029621558,0.015830636,0.14474805,0.006380522,-0.03358337,-0.044842523,0.038545992,-0.022079544,0.07782151,0.008314705,0.016102072,-0.029638762,0.0073139276,-0.005104253,0.05468659,0.003999741,0.0076132664,0.04160424,-0.037742015,0.05569243,0.02699005,-0.028068101,0.0060941465,0.018981006,0.057206187,0.028066875,-0.042770542,0.0011098217,-0.033193395,0.029596722,-0.010771898,0.032711275,0.005974733,-0.017933872,0.010475767,-0.03616161,0.03171415,0.00051158725,-0.0064528105,-0.018263241,0.021760968,0.026448742,0.0028469702,0.0042817434,-0.060105335,-0.018966394,0.031334013,0.04284711,-0.023035197,0.030252066,-0.0022116643,-0.005323065,0.0010192568,-0.010412998,0.032359645,-0.011189707,0.016231846,-0.034639746,-0.05971214,-0.02527579,0.0048448374,-0.07295156,0.09622417,0.04747041,-0.046072084,-0.02393421,-0.037538834,0.024069777,-0.016657453,-0.006631166,0.04486578,-0.000357994,0.040332593,0.021007624,0.018927688,0.0039107795,-0.008775884,0.01567115,0.021727908,0.06451652,0.03354658,-0.031538337,-0.051277418,0.06043929,0.029878039,0.0010104865,0.023635546,0.005943456,0.010380255,-0.039126743,-0.02260928,-0.119673006,-0.02173378,-0.051053964,-0.061633885,-0.01878763,-0.0058462447,-0.046420194,0.0642484,-0.02499378,-0.01827902,0.020665353,0.06764527,-0.00040288895,0.006955883,-0.020618174,-0.0028288872